{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538520/extras/13337193af436897aea9351a55236354.avif?t=1763055769\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538520/extras_big/13337193af436897aea9351a55236354.avif?t=1763055769 width=800 height=136 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whitefall \u2013 Smooth, Stylish, Satisfying.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whitefall is a precision platformer where every jump feels perfect. With simple controls, flowing movement, and bold modern visuals, it delivers pure platforming joy from the very first moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Smooth Controls</strong> \u2013 Jump, dash, and land with effortless precision.<br>\ud83c\udf04 <strong>Striking Visuals</strong> \u2013 Clean, modern worlds that stand out at a glance.<br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Simple Yet Deep</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, satisfying to master.<br>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Pure Platforming Fun</strong> \u2013 No clutter, no noise \u2014 just great gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play for a quick session or chase mastery over hours, <strong>Whitefall</strong> is platforming at its most stylish and satisfying.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538520?t=1763055769","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538520?t=1763055769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538520/66495aaedaf6065421d30f8aff7fef221469c2dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763055769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538520/66495aaedaf6065421d30f8aff7fef221469c2dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763055769","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full cont